<title>INDIA: India's Birla VXL 96/97 net falls.</title>
<headline>India's Birla VXL 96/97 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     206.0 vs   219.7</p>
<p>    Div (percent)	   10   vs     N/A</p>
<p>    Net sales	    5,655.9 vs 5,356.5</p>
<p>    Other income	   290.1 vs    41.6</p>
<p>Total expenditure  4,697.3 vs 4,448.6</p>
<p>    Interest costs	 735.0 vs   487.8</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   286.7 vs   204.5</p>
<p>    Tax			 21.0 vs     nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Textile maker Birla VXL Ltd released the results in a statement.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
